{"id":"5ba2593b4f2ccd8a","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-indescribable-hierarchy.md","title":"Indescribable Hierarchy","display":"df-indescribable-hierarchy — Indescribable Hierarchy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-indescribable-hierarchy","aliases":["58-df-indescribable-hierarchy"],"display":"df-indescribable-hierarchy — Indescribable Hierarchy","depends_on":["[[58-df-indescribable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-indescribable-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-indescribable-hierarchy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-indescribable-hierarchy — Indescribable Hierarchy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed949cc2262231c7\" href=\"?note=ed949cc2262231c7\" title=\"58-df-indescribable\">58-df-indescribable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}\\)</span> is the rank-reflection predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed949cc2262231c7\" href=\"?note=ed949cc2262231c7\" title=\"58-df-indescribable\">58-df-indescribable</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Indescribable}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Indescribable}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> is the indexed predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indescribable\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Indescribable}_S(\\kappa,n,m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indescribable\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Indescribable}_S(\\kappa,n,m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom is a typed three-argument interface to the canonical reflection scheme; a formula pointclass is not passed as an untyped set argument.</li>\n<li>Weakly compact cardinals are <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\">\\(\\Pi^1_1\\)</span>-indescribable, while total indescribability quantifies over all finite indices.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-indescribable","status":"resolved","id":"ed949cc2262231c7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-indescribable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-indescribable","status":"resolved","id":"ed949cc2262231c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}$ is the rank-reflection predicate from [[58-df-indescribable]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Indescribable}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}indescribable\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Indescribable}_S(\\kappa,n,m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\Pi^n_m}(\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1","display":false}],"bytes":994,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-667","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-indescribable-hierarchy.md|58-df-indescribable-hierarchy]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["ed949cc2262231c7"]}